          </div>
          <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
          <div>
            <span>After config parsing</span>
            <strong>
              <InlineCode code="ParsedCommandLine[]" language="typescript" />
            </strong>
            <p>File lists and options for the root config and every visited reference.</p>
          </div>
          <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
          <div>
            <span>After program creation</span>
            <strong>
              <InlineCode code="SourceFile[]" language="typescript" />
            </strong>
            <p>Compiler syntax trees ready for supported import extraction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="analysis-limit">
          <strong>The compiler sees more than the extractor records.</strong>
          <p>
            The <InlineCode code="Program" language="typescript" /> may understand declarations,
            aliases, JSX, and many expression forms. This extractor intentionally records supported
            top-level <InlineCode code="ImportDeclaration" language="typescript" /> nodes. Compiler
