  <section class="deep-section deep-lab-section" id="resolve-graph">
    <div class="deep-shell">
      <div class="deep-section-heading deep-section-heading--wide">
        <p class="deep-kicker">Chapter 03 / Resolve and build the graph</p>
        <h2>Syntax proves that an import exists. Resolution proves what it points to.</h2>
        <p>
          A parser returns the written module text and its syntax context. The same text can
          identify different files depending on the importing file, project root, package layout,
          aliases, and language configuration. A graph needs stable file identities, so the adapter
          must resolve that text before recording an edge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="adapter-panel"
        id="adapter-resolve-python"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="adapter-tab-python"
        data-adapter-panel="python"
        data-adapter-stage="resolve"
